    <fr:title text="Design vocal performance DSL in Haskell">Design vocal performance DSL in Haskell</fr:title>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p>Design an embedded domain-specific language for describing vocal performances with metadata like pitch curves, duration, dynamics, and effects. This sits on top of TidalCycles and compiles down to SuperCollider synthesis calls. Start by prototyping in Haskell, then consider lifting it into Agda for dependent-type constraints.</html:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
